+- Full patch: `.ai/plans/2026-04-12-120521-deterministic-slice-contract/artifacts/codex-review/diff.patch`
+
+Important constraints:
+- Review ONLY the patch captured in `diff.patch`, which represents `HEAD ->
+  current working tree`, excluding `.ai/handoffs/`.
+- This is not a `main...HEAD` review. Ignore stacked branch history.
+- Read the actual changed files for context.
+- Do NOT run test suites, `mise`, or long-running commands.
+- Prefer file reads over additional command execution.
+- Prefer no findings over speculative noise.
+
+Review lenses:
+1. Correctness and discrete bugs introduced by this patch.
+2. Completeness of the new plan/spec/evidence/review contract.
+3. Drift between docs, templates, and validator behavior.
+4. Obvious maintainability or enforcement gaps worth fixing before handoff.
+
+Write the final review to:
+`.ai/plans/2026-04-12-120521-deterministic-slice-contract/artifacts/codex-review/review.md`
+
+Use this exact output structure:
+
+## Executive Summary
+
+## Findings
+- Severity | File | Issue | Suggested fix
+
+## Bug Hunter Verdict
+
+## Positive Observations
