+Review written to [review.md](/Users/alex.furrier/git_repositories/agent-scaffold/.ai/plans/2026-04-12-120521-deterministic-slice-contract/artifacts/codex-review/review.md).
+
+Main findings are all contract-enforcement gaps in the new handoff validator:
+- `plan-check` accepts prose-only `TODO.md` content even though the contract says it must be a checkable task list.
+- `evidence-check` can still be satisfied by prose that merely mentions commands, without a real executed-command record.
+- `review-check` does not enforce `Reviewer`, so `REVIEW.md` can pass with `Reviewer: pending`.
